Synchronization - semaphore

Semaphore:
 - SystemV
 - SystemD:
  + Named
  + Unamed

systemV:
 - No file name
 - access(), ftok(), semget(), semctl(), semop()

systemD named:
 - File on RAM
 - sem_open(), sem_wait(), sem_post(), sem_getvalue(), sem_close, sem_unlink()

systemD unamed:
 - File on RAM
 - sem_init(), sem_wait(), sem_post(), sem_destroy()

